+                # Timing journal: stage into the actual upload directory
+                # (Full uploads DiagnosticDirectory, not CaptureDirectory;
+                # the diagnostic copier excludes the journal). The directory
+                # may already exist from an early snapshot. A retention
+                # failure must not mask the original failure.
+                #
+                # Quiescence proof is required before staging: the current
+                # capture must have a child Pid AND that process must be
